  "worked_solution": "The solutions $(x,y)$ of the system correspond to the intersection points of the two curves.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14190078/assets/83a2271a5f0620bcb97698d8b04367e6935f1e8cd6c25f6d2538aeb411c75a9f.png)\n\nWe see from the graph that the curves intersect at \n\n$\\,$ $(-3,2)\\,$ and $\\,(3,2).$ \n\nTherefore, these are the solutions of the corresponding system.",
